    "description": "Workshop, level 1 of 3: shell and fittings (what soldiers build first). The kingdom's workshop for everything that isn't wood (stage 6b). Stone hall with an open front bay. L1 the stone bench (crafting table, grindstone, raw stone pile); L2 the kiln (stonecutter, glass windows, brick kiln with two furnaces and a stack, sand and clay heaps); L3 the forge (anvil, blast furnace, quench tub, ore and coal lean-to, banner, lamp post). Stonecutter, anvil and blast furnace are not builder-tested yet.",
